-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(M)$ to store Gaussian parameters.
-- **Measured Performance:** Significantly slower than splatting due to per-ray evaluation and lack of efficient rasterization optimizations [S1].
-- **Scaling:** Performance degrades linearly with the number of Gaussians unless spatial acceleration is used.
